sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Customer
  participant W as WAF / DDoS
  participant G as API Gateway
  participant I as IAM
  participant B as Channel BFF
  U->>W: TLS request
  W->>W: Bot, rate and threat checks
  W->>G: Allowed request
  G->>I: Validate token / MFA state
  I-->>G: Identity and assurance context
  G->>B: Authenticated request + correlation
  B-->>G: Channel response
  G-->>U: Response

